6. RESPONSIVE — three tiers, keyed to frame SHAPE not device width
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
── TIER 2 · COMPACT ──
@media (max-aspect-ratio: 87/80), (max-width: 899px), (max-height: 639px){
  :root{--u: min(100vw / 880, 100vh / 1220); --pad: 52}
