=====================================================================
4. HTML BODY (exact order and copy)
=====================================================================
4-point star SVG path (used for logo and loader), viewBox "0 0 40 40":
M20 0c1.2 11.5 8.5 18.8 20 20-11.5 1.2-18.8 8.5-20 20-1.2-11.5-8.5-18.8-20-20C11.5 18.8 18.8 11.5 20 0z
